===== Specific Configuration =====

==== Serial ====

  - Wire up TP1 with TP3, TP2 with TP4 at the back side of the PCB (the side with nearly no chips).
  - With the antenna connector at the top-left position, pins for TTL connection are at the bottom-right with the following layout

        (Antenna Connector)----------
        |                           |
        |                           |
        |                 GND,RX,TX |
        -----------------------------

Information about serial port connection for this device can be found at [[https://wikidevi.com/wiki/HiWiFi_HC6361|WikiDevi for HiWiFi HC6361]]

-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

